@title Work cards: the PDF asks where to save, then says the folder
@area 3D
# 3D > Layers > Build order > "Work cards (PDF)" opens a save dialog (title "Save the work cards", file name "<project> work cards.pdf", starting next to the project) instead of writing silently. After the answer the status line names the file and its folder and keeps the "Open folder" button.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 40
click_text "Layers"
wait 8
click_text "Build order"
wait 8
key Escape
wait 30
click_text "Next"
wait 12
click_text "Next"
wait 12
shot strip-with-work-cards-button
expect "Work cards (PDF)"
answer_dialog "~/Documents/KoperCAD/qa 213 chosen name.pdf"
click_text "Work cards (PDF)"
wait 40
expect_dialog "suggested name Motor starter (example) work cards.pdf"
shot after-save
expect "qa 213 chosen name.pdf"
expect "Open folder"
expect_file "~/Documents/KoperCAD/qa 213 chosen name.pdf" 3000
check_layout
